      "text": "Father raiseth up the dead, and quickeneth them, John 5:21. It is the spirit that quickeneth, John 6:63. God, who quickeneth the dead, Rom. 4:17. quicken your mortal bodies by his Spirit, Rom. 8:11. that which thou sowest is not quickened, 1 Cor. 15:36. last Adam was made a quickening spirit, 1 Cor. 15:45. you hath he quickened, Eph. 2:1. hath quickened us together with Christ, Eph. 2:5 (Col. 2:13). God, who quickeneth all things, 1 Tim. 6:13. Christ … put to death in the flesh, but quickened by the Spirit, 1 Pet. 3:18 (D&C 138:7).",
